* An escaped quote outside quotes in a macro argument (STR \""ab> \""): a quote, not the start
* of a string (the operand field went to the blank in it); r68 takes the quote, then the quoted
* part without its quotes, \" in it a quote: "ab> ".
* fixed: 1b639cc 2026-10-11 r68togas: an escaped quote outside quotes
* expect text: 0461623e 20055859 5a3a2000 4e714e71
STR macro
 dc.b Len\@
Beg\@ equ *
 dc.b \1
 ifgt \#-1
 dc.b \2
 endc
Len\@ set *-Beg\@
 endm
 psect macro_arg_escquote,0,0,0,0,0
P STR \""ab> \""
Q STR "\"XYZ: \""
 nop
 ends
